@* Mirrors the server's fallback authorization policy: every page requires a signed-in
   user unless it opts out with [AllowAnonymous]. Adding a page therefore protects it by
   default rather than by remembering to. The pages that must stay open are Login,
   Register, ForgotPassword, ResetPassword and NotFound. *@
@attribute [Authorize]
